{"id":1014,"date":"2025-04-11T12:36:51","date_gmt":"2025-04-11T12:36:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/?p=1014"},"modified":"2025-04-11T12:36:51","modified_gmt":"2025-04-11T12:36:51","slug":"tu-carnet-de-manipulacion-de-alimentos-esta-vencido-es-momento-de-revalidarlo","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/tu-carnet-de-manipulacion-de-alimentos-esta-vencido-es-momento-de-revalidarlo\/","title":{"rendered":"\u00bfTu carnet de manipulaci\u00f3n de alimentos est\u00e1 vencido? \u00a1Es momento de revalidarlo!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Mantener tu Carnet de Manipulaci\u00f3n de Alimentos actualizado no solo es una obligaci\u00f3n legal, sino tambi\u00e9n una muestra de compromiso con la seguridad alimentaria y la salud p\u00fablica.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En ISETA, con una amplia trayectoria en formaci\u00f3n, hemos acompa\u00f1ado a numerosas personas a lo largo de los a\u00f1os que confiaron en nosotros tanto para capacitarse como para cumplir con esta normativa fundamental.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\u00bfNecesitas revalidarlo?<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Solo ten\u00e9s que enviar una captura del carnet vencido o del certificado del curso de manipulador a nuestro correo: <a href=\"mailto:isetacerealesycalidad@gmail.com\"><strong>isetacerealesycalidad@gmail.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Te acompa\u00f1amos en cada paso para que sigas cumpliendo con la normativa vigente de manera f\u00e1cil y segura.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"> \u00a1Con ISETA, tu capacitaci\u00f3n est\u00e1 en buenas manos!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Mantener tu Carnet de Manipulaci\u00f3n de Alimentos actualizado no solo es una obligaci\u00f3n legal, sino tambi\u00e9n una muestra de compromiso &hellip; <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1015,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[13,14,15,12,16],"class_list":["post-1014","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-sin-categoria","tag-carnetmanipulador","tag-educacion","tag-educacion-2","tag-manipulaciondealimentos","tag-superior"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1014","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1014"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1014\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1016,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1014\/revisions\/1016"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1015"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1014"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1014"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=1014"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}